-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Relationships aren’t one-size-fits-all  and every relationship can become difficult to manage sometimes. </span>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-e40d1da elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"e40d1da\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8c9771d\" data-id=\"8c9771d\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bb0ea4b elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"bb0ea4b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\"> Let me ask you…</h4>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-be26f67 elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"be26f67\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4da4b9c\" data-id=\"4da4b9c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-fd5adff elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"fd5adff\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>/*! elementor - v3.23.0 - 05-08-2024 */\n.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-stacked .elementor-drop-cap{background-color:#69727d;color:#fff}.elementor-widget-text-editor.elementor-drop-cap-view-framed .elementor-drop-cap{color:#69727d;border:3px solid;background-color:transparent}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap{margin-top:8px}.elementor-widget-text-editor:not(.elementor-drop-cap-view-default) .elementor-drop-cap-letter{width:1em;height:1em}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap{float:left;text-align:center;line-height:1;font-size:50px}.elementor-widget-text-editor .elementor-drop-cap-letter{display:inline-block}</style>\t\t\t\t<p>Are you a woman tired of navigating burn-out, stress, heartbreak and the work/life balance? Has the landscape of your life shifted in such huge ways that you have been forced to stop and consider where you are going and how you are living your life?</p><p>If these resonate with you, then I’m glad we are meeting here. Perhaps you’re here because…</p><p>You’re an amazing, intelligent, loving woman whose heart longs for healthy, happy partnership…</p><p>Deep down you know your self-worth, confidence and perception of your lovability….</p><p>Secretly you’re frightened you’ll always be alone or that you aren’t enough…</p><p>You’re stuck in painful patterns and your relationships always end the same way…the wrong way…</p><p>But let me tell you, you’re not alone….</p><p>I myself have struggled with relationships in my life. I wondered, “Is there anything wrong with me?” , “Why am I attracting the same kind of people in my life?”, “How do I snap away from these negative patterns and turn a new leaf?”.</p><p>And then during my own journey of working on myself and training as a relationship coach, I found a way out of my woes.</p><p>Today in this journey I focus on working with dynamic and ambitious women whom I inspire and empower to reconnect with their true selves.</p><p>Today I help young women especially from GenX and GenY to achieve relationships they truly deserve without having to compromise.</p><p>Let’s live big, let’s live awesome, let’s strive for greatness, let’s live the life we always knew we could</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-4263ae2\" data-id=\"4263ae2\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7d350d7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"7d350d7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1230\" src=\"/images/relationship.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full wp-image-4630\" alt=\"\" />\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-9e1e016 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"9e1e016\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8fe3c6c\" data-id=\"8fe3c6c\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-c2cffc4 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"c2cffc4\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-1db1171\" data-id=\"1db1171\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f72cc95 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f72cc95\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">I know you want more from your relationships</h4>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8484f6f elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8484f6f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We were never made to be alone and that is what beneath everything else, this is the fundamental reason we crave for love and compatibility. But let&#8217;s be honest. Things are not always smooth and roses. It is going to get rough. Also just like every other thing, even a healthy relationship does not come from a place of complacency. It comes when both partners step out of their comfort zones and put in the effort to make it work.</p><p>So let&#8217;s face it, you are here because you want more.</p><p>You are here because you want to know what to do when it gets rough? You are here because you are looking to break the patterns behind why it never works out?</p><p>You are here because you want to know how to get the right partner and sustain it! And oh yes, you are here because you want to know how the heck to make it work so it sustains.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-c45eee7\" data-id=\"c45eee7\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-0768d9a elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"0768d9a\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-45f5134\" data-id=\"45f5134\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1bc3c87 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"1bc3c87\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div>Think of me as your personal trainer but for your heart. My aim here is to get you into the best possible shape so that you can cover the relationship journey to your best.</div><div> </div><div>I work with you if you feel love is complicated. Because I feel love does not need to be complicated and relationships don&#8217;t need to be hard, And together we can create a love  life that you truly deserve.</div><div> </div><div>I work with you to get you back on track so that you feel empowered to be able to love and be loved fully.</div><div> </div><div>Let&#8217;s start fresh. We work together so that you can thrive by breaking self-sabotaging patterns in dating and relationships. It is time for you to move past everything that holds you back. I know you want to unpack the past baggage, close those doors behind and open new ones to walk into a healthier, happy version of yourself and your relationships.</div><div> </div><div><p>Investing in working with me gives you the opportunity to get access to proven tools and techniques that actually work.<br />It&#8217;s fast-tracking your growth and transformation towards love and relationships.</p></div>\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-2a4bd47 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"2a4bd47\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-28487ae\" data-id=\"28487ae\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-97423b7 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"97423b7\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<h4 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Ways to work with me</h4>\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-13800fa elementor-section-full_width elementor-section-height-default elementor-secti